{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Through field and vineyard.</b> That they would not destroy, and even the water of your wells we would not drink." "<b>The king's highway we will go.</b> Whether the road on which the king travels, or its meaning is the road that the king—who is the king of Edom—commands, we will go."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:31.902725634Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}